Maintainer: Ying Jiang <96768072+jiangcongxin@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Simulation and modeling utilities for marker-anchored
    negative-binomial estimation of fibroblast state mixtures from single-cell
    count data. The package supports fixed cell-specific reference-logit
    anchors, optional study and donor effects, known-truth recovery diagnostics,
    and held-out count-prediction benchmarks.
